# ============================ VinaX environment ============================
# Frontend (Vite). PUBLIC — never put secrets in VITE_* variables.
# Optional overrides; the app works with none of these set.
# VITE_API_BASES=https://saavn.dev/api,https://saavn.sumit.co/api
# VITE_APP_NAME=VinaX

# ------- Server-side secrets (Cloudflare WORKER `vinax-api`) -------
# Set with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME> --config worker/wrangler.toml
# (or Workers dashboard -> vinax-api -> Settings -> Variables & Secrets).
# They live on the Worker, never on Pages, and never reach the client.
# This file documents names only — real values belong in Cloudflare (or a local
# .dev.vars for `npm run dev:worker`, which is gitignored).
#
# AI lanes — generation-5 env names (v5.4.0). Each lane pins its own model +
# provider base in code — see functions/_lib/ai.ts (lanes) and
# functions/_lib/models.ts (AI_MODEL_REGISTRY, the full model inventory with
# capabilities and live-probe health notes). NVIDIA NIM keys are nvapi-...
# unless noted. Every pinned slug was probed live on its own key before
# pinning — never pin an unprobed slug.
#
# Feature lanes (each drives features today):
# VINAX_DEEPSEEK_V4_FLASH        chat — assistant · AI Playlists · mood recs
#                                (serves gpt-oss-20b; the deepseek-v4-flash
#                                slug itself hangs upstream — see registry)
# VINAX_CHATGPT_20_B             fast — quick tasks · instant answers
# VINAX_NEMOTRON_SUPER           deep — the Think button (nemotron-3-super-120b)
# VINAX_GROQ_API_KEY             scholar — music knowledge · lyrics · LIVE voice
#                                (Groq console key gsk_..., calls api.groq.com)
# VINAX_NEMOTRON_3_5_LIGHTNING_30B_A3B
#                                dj — AI DJ · Smart Radio · smart queue
#                                (nemotron-3.5-lightning, realtime class)
# VINAX_NEMOTRON_ULTRA           home — premium reasoning backstop (550B; slow,
#                                always last in latency-sensitive ladders)
# VINAX_NVIDIA_NEMOTRON_3_NANO_30B_A3B
#                                search — search-page music expert · discovery
#
# Reserve / special-purpose lanes (wired, probed healthy):
# VINAX_DEEPSEEK_V4_PRO          pro — deep-reasoning ladder reserve
# VINAX_MINIMAX_M3               mini — general ladder reserve
# VINAX_RIVA_TRANSLATE_4B_INSTRUCT_V2
#                                translate — lyrics/UI translation
# VINAX_NEMOTRON_3_5_CONTENT_SAFETY
#                                safety — moderation of AI-generated text
# VINAX_LLAMA_3_1_NEMOTRON_SAFETY_GUARD_8B_V3
#                                guard — safety second opinion
# VINAX_NEMOTRON_3_EMBED_1B      embeddings (2048-dim) via ai.ts embed()
# VINAX_KIMI_K3                  agent — premium reserve; probed UNSTABLE
#                                2026-08-29, wired but drives nothing yet
#
# Inventory only (keys accepted, models NOT serving on the NIM catalog as of
# the 2026-08-29 probe — see models.ts notes before wiring any of these):
# VINAX_CHATGPT_120_B            (gpt-oss-120b hung on NVIDIA since v3.7.0)
# VINAX_MUSE_GLIMMER_30B         (404) VINAX_NEMOTRON_VOICECHAT (404)
# VINAX_LAGUNA_XS_2_1            (404) VINAX_RIVA_TRANSLATE_4B_INSTRUCT_V1_1 (404)
# VINAX_ISING_CALIBRATION_1_5_31B / VINAX_ISING_CALIBRATION_1_35B_A3B (410 Gone)
# VINAX_GEMMA_4_31B_IT           (hangs) VINAX_DIFFUSIONGEMMA_26B_A4B_IT (text only)
# VINAX_SYNTHETIC_VIDEO_DETECTOR / VINAX_ACTIVE_SPEAKER_DETECTION /
# VINAX_STREAMPETR               (not chat models; no adapter or surface yet)
#
# NVIDIA_BASE_URL optional DEFAULT endpoint override (lanes without a LANE_BASE pin)
#
# Database (Supabase — service key must NEVER ship to clients):
# SUPABASE_URL
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# Admin console (…/admin — gates every /api/admin endpoint):
# ADMIN_LOGIN_PASSWORD long random secret
#
# Web push (VAPID keypair, generate once and keep):
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY base64url, 65-byte uncompressed P-256 point
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY base64url, 32-byte P-256 scalar
# VAPID_SUBJECT mailto:owner@example.com
#
# Telemetry / device-id signing (audit finding H-SRV-6):
# TELEMETRY_PEPPER HMAC pepper for aggregate-mode device-id hashing;
# also seeds the in-memory rate-limiter key hash so
# plaintext IPs never sit in isolate memory
# (H-SRV-11). Set a long random secret.
# DEVICE_ID_SECRET HMAC secret for /api/events signed_device_id.
# The client stores signed_device_id_next returned
# from first-contact posts and echoes it forever
# after. Falls back to TELEMETRY_PEPPER when unset,
# but a dedicated value is recommended so the two
# can be rotated independently.
#
# Scheduled jobs (GitHub Actions cron -> /api/cron/*):
# CRON_SECRET shared secret; requests without it are rejected
# (header x-cron-secret only — ?key= is no longer
# accepted, audit finding H-SRV-7)
#
# Optional integrations:
# BRAVE_API_KEY web search inside VinaX AI
# GITHUB_REPO owner/repo used by the APK release endpoint
# GITHUB_TOKEN optional; raises GitHub API rate limits

# Native Android background push (FCM) — optional; enables notifications
# even when the app is fully closed. See docs/fcm-push-setup.md.
# FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT Firebase service-account JSON (whole file, as a string)
